  m_text: 'Administration Time

    Self-paced

    Directions

    Say, Answer the
    following questions. Present the items.

    Scoring

    Score 2 points if the
    target response or a reasonable alternative response is given (e.g., Nurses work
    in a ... clinic). Score 1 point for a phonemic paraphasia or off-target alternative
    responses (e.g., Nurses work in an... office). Score 0 points for an unreasonable
